<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES - Dean Foods, International Rectifier, Western Digital.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES - Dean Foods, International Rectifier, Western Digital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Dean Foods Co, International Rectifier Corp and Western Digital Corp were unavailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable was Corimon SACA.</p>
</text>
